The proper technique to rob Sam is actually to exit on the square next to  
the portal and move to the portal. When exiting directly to the portal,  
nasties will appear on the other side as you have experienced.

I'm quite surprised you were stressed as a Xorn. Xorn have high carrying  
capacity (1000) iirc and a blessed BoH is able to hold a lot of stuff. Did  
you drop (almost) all you stuff in the dungeon before going for the  
robbery ? Did you picked up too many things at Sam's ? I robbed him  
several time, and never went as far as stressed (not even burdened), a  
full BoH (around 800) was enough to carry everything. Of course, I usually  
don't bother with mundanes armor or weapons or comestible since I have  
more than enought at that point in the game. Only scrolls, potions, wands,  
rings and spellbooks.

And once you were out and surrounded, you should have first take a turn to  
drop the heavy bags. This would have leave you unburdened and more able to  
deal with the crowd. Items alone do not trigger portals.


